，張丑偽謂楚王曰：「王所以戰勝於徐州者，田盻子不用也。盻子者，有功於國，而百姓爲之用。嬰子弗善而用申紀。申紀者，大臣不附，百姓不爲用，故王勝之也。今王逐嬰子，嬰子逐，盻子必用矣。復搏其士卒以與王遇，必不便於王矣。」楚王因弗逐也。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p065","quote":"十一年，威王卒，子懷王熊槐立。魏聞楚喪，伐楚，取我陘山。"}],"rationale":"依本篇明示立、是為及連續敘事暫接，未自動與其他篇候選合併；匿名身分、追稱與年代仍待核。 按本段介紹、說話者與對象及前後同一外交事件暫接；袖限鄭袖，儀限張儀，秦惠／昭與楚懷／頃襄依列出的事件分開。先王客死於秦的譬喻限楚懷王；稱王建議不作新授位。 原字不改，身份與版本仍待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p062","text":"宣王六年，周天子賀秦獻公。秦始復彊，而三晉益大，魏惠王、齊威王尤彊。三十年，秦封衞鞅於商，南侵楚。是年，宣王卒，子威王熊商立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001921","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"周天子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"賀秦獻公的周王未明姓名，待按版本與任時證據核對。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"秦獻公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002028","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"魏惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002029","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001922","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"衞鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002030","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001921","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m062-0057","start":57,"end":61,"surface":"威王熊商","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001922","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p063","text":"威王六年，周顯王致文武胙於秦惠王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m063-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001922","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m063-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"周顯王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002031","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m063-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"文武胙","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"祭祀胙稱的文武並稱，並非在場個人；與姓名、受胙者及爵位授予分開。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m063-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"秦惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000290","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p064","text":"七年，齊孟嘗君父田嬰欺楚，楚威王伐齊，敗之於徐州，而令齊必逐田嬰。田嬰恐，張丑偽謂楚王曰：「王所以戰勝於徐州者，田盻子不用也。盻子者，有功於國，而百姓爲之用。嬰子弗善而用申紀。申紀者，大臣不附，百姓不爲用，故王勝之也。今王逐嬰子，嬰子逐，盻子必用矣。復搏其士卒以與王遇，必不便於王矣。」楚王因弗逐也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m064-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"孟嘗君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002032","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m064-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"田嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001985","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m064-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"楚威王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001922","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m064-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"田嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001985","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m064-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"田嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001985","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m064-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"張丑","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001986","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m064-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"楚王","kind":"per